{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2023-03-27 20:09:00', 'title': 'PG&E OUTLINES CONTINUED RISK-INFORMED IMPROVEMENTS TO WILDFIRE SAFETY EFFORTS THROUGH 2025', 'text': "COMPANY'S LATEST WILDFIRE MITIGATION PLAN BUILDS UPON PROVEN LAYERS OF PROTECTION, INTRODUCES NEW TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS \xa0\xa0 OAKLAND, CALIF. , MARCH 27, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BUILDING UPON PROVEN LAYERS OF PROTECTION THAT HAVE REDUCED WILDFIRE RISK FROM THE COMPANY'S EQUIPMENT BY MORE THAN 90%1, PACIFIC GAS AND ELECTRIC COMPANY (PG&E) TODAY SHARED ITS MULTI-FACETED, RISK-INFORMED STRATEGY AIMED AT CONTINUING TO CLOSE THE GAP ON THE REMAINING 10% OF WILDFIRE RISK."}